  "limitations": [
    "The frozen X5 F50 contract asks for representative distinct native special-effect families and real contact, expanding only distinct deferred emitters. The mutable imported every-acquired-family wording was broader; it is corrected to that frozen scope. No every-weapon, charged/armor or general artwork claim.",
