    "F27 remains unverified. Its actual current LOCAL ice33 graphics/expiry are positive but two later landing-observer timeouts are preserved and NET ice is missing. No frozen fire/ice comparison credit, native3330 coverage, WAN/cross-host, production, campaign progress, state-load or rollback claim."
